;'EQUATE TO      T0CON1 7:5      3:0        T0CON0 3:0
;'ASSUMED FOR CODE BELOW TIMER0 IS 16-BIT CAPABLE AS WE HAVE BEEN PASSED THREE PARAMETERS
;'SET PRESCALER
